  "description": "Diana, a blind maid with a carefully guarded past, is forced by Prince Eisen to spy on the Crown Prince. She expects to find a sickly recluse who spends his days painting in solitude, but the man she encounters is nothing like the rumors. Will she survive the dangers awaiting her in his palace?\n\n**Original Novel:**    \nR19: [Chapters](https://ridibooks.com/books/4863000241), [Volumes](https://ridibooks.com/books/4863000648)  \nR15: [Chapters](https://ridibooks.com/books/4863000242) \n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \nR19: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/6360000001)     \nR15: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/6360000002) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \nR19: [English](https://manta.net/en/series/a-portrait-of-pride-full-ver?seriesId=5617)   \nR15: [English](https://manta.net/en/series/a-portrait-of-pride?seriesId=5669)",
